# A profile ledger whose legend is not the vocabulary it uses

## 2. Current milestone status

The legend below publishes a mark the rule does not expect and omits one it requires, which is the
same pair of failures the component's own legend is held to - a legend that may publish a fourth
mark is not a closed vocabulary, and one that may drop a member leaves a mark in the table above
it that nothing defines.

| Mark | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `[NONE]` | The row has retained evidence of no kind. |
| `[SOME]` | A fourth mark, published by a legend that says it has three. |
| `[FULL]` | The row's bundle demonstrates every exit-gate clause. |
